# Raw scraped JPS telemetry (~200MB+) and the processed train/test CSVs
# built from it (~90MB) — both regeneratable via `python -m ml.fetch_data`
# then `python -m ml.build_dataset`, and neither is what Section 7.1 asks
# to be persisted for reproducibility (that's the model + feature list +
# metrics in backend/models/, which are small and ARE committed).
# manifest.json (composition/counts/date ranges, not the row data itself)
# is kept, not ignored — see the !-negation below.
ml/data/raw/
ml/data/processed/*.csv


